CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786112310
OL,3,CScientists use AI to design new
OL,4,Cviruses never seen before in nature
OL,6,FScientists have used artificial
OL,7,Fintelligence to create new viruses ` a
OL,8,Fhopeful step toward medical advances
OL,9,Fthat also raises serious concerns
OL,10,Faround potential misuse.
OL,12,FResearchers from Stanford University
OL,13,Fand the Arc Institute used the AI to
OL,14,Fgenerate thousands of genome
OL,15,Fcombinations within a specific
OL,16,Fframework ` specifically one that
OL,17,Fcould be hosted by an E. coli bacteria
OL,18,Fcell.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
