FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786112310
OL,3,CScientists use AI to design new
OL,4,Cviruses never seen before in nature
OL,6,FOf the thousands of genomes that the
OL,7,FAI generated, scientists built and
OL,8,Ftested about 300 in the lab and found
OL,9,Fthat 16 were viable viruses.
OL,11,FThe new viruses are bacteriophages,
OL,12,Fwhich infect bacteria but cannot
OL,13,Faffect humans.
OL,15,FThe study, published on Thursday in
OL,16,Fthe journal Science, says that genetic
OL,17,Fsequences from millions of sources
OL,18,F"from all domains of life" served as
OL,19,Fthe language library for the AI tool
OL,20,FEvo.
OL,26,@zD@AOUzD@ZO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786112310
OL,3,CScientists use AI to design new
OL,4,Cviruses never seen before in nature
OL,6,FMuch like Chat-GPT and other large
OL,7,Flanguage models, AI tool Evo was
OL,8,Ftrained on large sets of existing text
OL,9,Fmaterial.
OL,11,FAccording to the research, the genetic
OL,12,Flibrary helped the AI "learn the
OL,13,Fevolutionary constraints" of natural
OL,14,Fgenomes.
OL,26,@tD@WOUuD@YO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786112310
OL,3,CScientists use AI to design new
OL,4,Cviruses never seen before in nature
OL,6,FHowever, the model appeared to go
OL,7,Ffurther, with scientists finding that
OL,8,Fone of the new viruses had an aspect
OL,9,Fthat was "evolutionarily distant" `
OL,10,Fsuggesting the AI prompted changes
OL,11,Fthat could have taken millions of
OL,12,Fyears for natural evolution to prove
OL,13,Fpossible.
OL,15,FTests showed that a mixture of the new
OL,16,Fviruses could overcome antibacterial
OL,17,Fresistance in some of the E. coli
OL,18,Fstrains, something that a "comparable
OL,19,Fmixture of naturally sourced"
OL,20,Fbacteriophages could not.
OL,26,@qD@JOUqD@aO]zD@[OU{D@]O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
