CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786112310
OL,3,CScientists use AI to design new
OL,4,Cviruses never seen before in nature
OL,6,FThis "lays out a path for generating
OL,7,Fadaptive and resilient phage therapies
OL,8,Fagainst rapidly evolving pathogens,"
OL,9,Fthe authors wrote.
OL,11,FThe work is a significant scientific
OL,12,Fmilestone, especially as scientists
OL,13,Frace to combat rising drug resistance
OL,14,Fwithin germs such as E. coli but it
OL,15,Falso raises questions about potential
OL,16,Fmisuse.
OL,18,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,19,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,20,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,21,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,26,@nD@FOUpD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
